# Broker ACL — /etc/mosquitto/aclfile
#
# One block per client. A board may publish only under its own prefix and read
# only its own command topic, so a compromised board cannot forge another
# device's readings or listen to another furnace's data.
#
# After editing: sudo systemctl reload mosquitto

# --- the server consumer (backend/mqtt/bridge.py) ---------------------------
user furnace-bridge
topic read  factory/+/+/telemetry
topic read  factory/+/+/status
topic read  factory/+/+/event
topic read  factory/+/+/cmd/ack
topic write factory/+/+/cmd

# --- devices ----------------------------------------------------------------
# Copy this block per board and change the id in both places.

user esp32_001
topic write factory/razi/esp32_001/telemetry
topic write factory/razi/esp32_001/status
topic write factory/razi/esp32_001/event
topic write factory/razi/esp32_001/cmd/ack
topic read  factory/razi/esp32_001/cmd
